atar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-21T05:43:12Z","updated_at":"2025-12-21T05:43:12Z","body":"That would be neat! However, I think it would require converting those TreeItems to using a custom draw callback, which might be a bit out of scope for this PR 😅\r\n\r\nI would like to add a toggle setting for this behavior to the PR though. As [Mickeon pointed out](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13514#issuecomment-3473948170), the text can take more space when using a monospaced font, so providing the option to disable it for people who want to save space would be nice.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3678483940/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3678487806","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112219#issuecomment-3678487806","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112219","id":3678487806,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bQUT-","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-21T05:49:32Z","updated_at":"2025-12-21T05:49:32Z","body":"> That would be neat! However, I think it would require converting those TreeItems to using a custom draw callback, which might be a bit out of scope for this PR 😅\r\n> \r\n> I would like to add a toggle setting for this behavior to the PR though. As [Mickeon pointed out](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13514#issuecomment-3473948170), the text can take more space when using a monospaced font, so providing the option to disable it for people who want to save space would be nice.\r\n\r\nYou may want to make another PR for it if it is out of the scope of this PR as it would be quite nice to have it.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3678487806/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3678679394","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112219#issuecomment-3678679394","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112219","id":3678679394,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bRDFi","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-21T10:42:30Z","updated_at":"2025-12-21T10:42:30Z","body":"Yeah, the colors are for another PR. I just saw the code font without any color and thought that something is missing.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3678679394/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3679451933","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112219#issuecomment-3679451933","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112219","id":3679451933,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bT_sd","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-21T20:34:23Z","updated_at":"2025-12-21T20:34:23Z","body":"The use of the monospaced font is now an editor setting at `interface/theme/use_monospace_font_for_editor_symbols`, enabled by default. I see that there are other font settings in the Editor category, so it could be moved there if others think that's a better idea.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n> You may want to make another PR for it if it is out of the scope of this PR as it would be quite nice to have it.\r\n\r\nPerhaps one day, but I feel like a proper solution that allows this would be rather intensive. The two approaches I can think of are:\r\n- Use custom drawing for these specific TreeItems, to draw text with different colors at the proper offsets. I feel like this would make the code for writing text in this tree unnecessarily complicated and confusing to other contributors.\r\n- Implement optional BBCode text drawing for TreeItems as a PR, and then do a follow-up PR that uses BBCode to color these specific TreeItems' text properly. This has the benefit of introducing functionality that could be used elsewhere, but I wouldn't be surprised if adding rich text to TreeItems is a large task 😅 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3679451933/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3680139581","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112219#issuecomment-3680139581","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112219","id":3680139581,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bWnk9","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-22T02:55:41Z","updated_at":"2025-12-22T02:55:41Z","body":"> Perhaps one day, but I feel like a proper solution that allows this would be rather intensive. The two approaches I can think of are:\r\n> \r\n> * Use custom drawing for these specific TreeItems, to draw text with different colors at the proper offsets. I feel like this would make the code for writing text in this tree unnecessarily complicated and confusing to other contributors.\r\n> * Implement optional BBCode text drawing for TreeItems as a PR, and then do a follow-up PR that uses BBCode to color these specific TreeItems' text properly. This has the benefit of introducing functionality that could be used elsewhere, but I wouldn't be surprised if adding rich text to TreeItems is a large task 😅\r\n\r\nIt's alright, I understand. If you need help, ping me.\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3680139581/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3952972386","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112219#issuecomment-3952972386","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112219","id":3952972386,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7rnZJi","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-24T15:34:58Z","updated_at":"2026-02-24T15:34:58Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3952972386/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":