5","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-04T18:06:22Z","updated_at":"2026-03-04T18:06:58Z","body":"@thottee You should be able to use the `interface/theme/use_monospace_font_for_editor_symbols` setting in the Editor Settings to turn it off. If that's not working (or it doesn't apply somewhere) then that's a bug we'll need to fix","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3999240825/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3999306859","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112219#issuecomment-3999306859","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112219","id":3999306859,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7uYJRr","user":{"login":"thottee","id":42456553,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNDU2NTUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42456553?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee","html_url":"https://github.com/thottee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-04T18:18:42Z","updated_at":"2026-03-04T18:18:42Z","body":"@Meorge Thank you very much for your answer. Don't get me wrong, I don't want to hurt your work. Anno Juan had a philosophy of giving the user as many options as possible for settings, especially if a change was not necessarily clearly better for him. There are a lot of changes in the engine lately that aren't necessarily better and aren't made optional. One example is the current TAA modification, which is true that it causes less ghosting, but it messed up my scene with much more noticeable flickering parts. I solved it because I had to restore 2 files from the previous version and build my own engine. However, when it affects many files that later undergo major updates, this is problematic. What you write is an opportunity, doesn't it spoil anything else?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3999306859/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3999325764","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112219#issuecomment-3999325764","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112219","id":3999325764,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7uYN5E","user":{"login":"thottee","id":42456553,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNDU2NTUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42456553?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee","html_url":"https://github.com/thottee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-04T18:22:02Z","updated_at":"2026-03-04T18:25:34Z","body":"so that I don't just write that I don't like it, I'll describe why. I really like it when the interface looks uniform. I'm very happy with the new font and uniform design, and I give all my credit to those who worked on it. However, if you look at this picture, for example, the font is uniform on the left and right. I tried it, I don't really like it so much that this uniformity is broken with these modifications. not very much, but a little. I welcome all options, as long as they are optional, as long as they don't necessarily make the software better, just different. for example, I like the modern theme, but I'm glad I have the option to choose the old one too.\r\n\r\noriginal:\r\n<img width=\"834\" height=\"1020\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/382bbd14-9a40-4f83-a895-d2f8ac194725\" />\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3999325764/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3999331964","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112219#issuecomment-3999331964","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112219","id":3999331964,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7uYPZ8","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-04T18:23:04Z","updated_at":"2026-03-04T18:27:34Z","body":"No worries! I agree that providing options in the editor is very good. I've sent a message to the folks running the blog and asked if we could add a part to it that describes how to disable the monospace font for those who don't want it.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, I'm not involved at all with TAA or related graphics things, so you'd be best off opening a separate proposal/issue for making that optional (and/or fixing the flickering issue). ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3999331964/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3999365350","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112219#issuecomment-3999365350","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112219","id":3999365350,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7uYXjm","user":{"login":"thottee","id":42456553,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNDU2NTUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42456553?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee","html_url":"https://github.com/thottee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thottee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-04T18:28:58Z","updated_at":"2026-03-04T18:28:58Z","body":"@Meorge thank you very much your answer, and I wish you all the best.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3999365350/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":1,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/i